WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.482
We are happy to choose the books ourselves.

2
00:00:10.483 --> 00:00:16.512
That way, we can read our favorites over and over.

3
00:00:16.513 --> 00:00:18.511
Dad : The end.

4
00:00:18.512 --> 00:00:20.938
Bada: That was a fun story.

5
00:00:20.939 --> 00:00:23.969
Dad: I am glad you liked it.

6
00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:27.106
Bada: Could you read it one more time, please?

7
00:00:27.107 --> 00:00:29.890
Dad: I'm afraid it is too late.

8
00:00:29.891 --> 00:00:33.061
I will read it to you tomorrow night.

9
00:00:33.062 --> 00:00:37.226
Bada: Well then, can I just look at the pictures again?

10
00:00:37.227 --> 00:00:41.088
Dad: All right. Don't stay up too long.

11
00:00:41.089 --> 00:00:43.506
Bada: Yes, Dad. Good night.

12
00:00:43.507 --> 00:00:47.792
Dad: Sleep tight.

13
00:00:47.793 --> 00:00:51.405
As you can see, Bada can't read yet.

14
00:00:51.406 --> 00:00:54.075
He is already seven years old!

15
00:00:54.076 --> 00:00:58.967
I learned to read and write when I was six years old.

16
00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:01.605
Oh well. What can you do?
